  "repo_truth":"Independent implementation discovery returned exactly five P2 findings. The current implementation is uncommitted and within ceilings. Four findings are bounded code/proof repairs. The fifth exposes that the selected 53-leaf binding cannot be produced by the immutable generic intake 15-distinct-output contract; no fifth production path or ceiling change is authorized.",
