  "non_goals":["No new production path, public name, dependency, unsafe/native/transport, schema/tool, HCM-3.3+, planning reopen, commit, staging, handoff/ledger, or review dispatch.","Do not weaken the closed binding, fake owner-produced lineage, or report seeded bytes as owner-produced."],
